ame in recent history than this?","filename":"o6994al65wwd1","ext":".png","w":1079,"h":1536,"tn_w":175,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789777447899758,"time":1789777447,"md5":"FcERgVyRo\/6DezDdTzmQlA==","fsize":1253714,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"um-actually-the-cross-isnt-holy-vampires-are-just","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":120,"images":24,"omitted_posts":115,"omitted_images":24,"last_replies":[{"no":747992883,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:44:19","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988798\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988798<\/a><br>Jeets can only ruin stuff","time":1789782259,"resto":747988798},{"no":747992893,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:44:25","name":"Anonymous","com":"Fucking right angles.<br>Really.","time":1789782265,"resto":747988798},{"no":747992925,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:02","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988798\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988798<\/a><br>This would\u2019ve worked if the explanation was something like:<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;crosses only work against vampires if they\u2019re carved in the exact proportions of the true cross<\/span><br>Like that would\u2019ve been a \u201chuh, neat idea\u201d moment","time":1789782302,"resto":747988798},{"no":747992962,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:42","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989995\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989995<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;If &quot;God&quot; is evil, what the hell is light magic and why does it fuck up the undead?<\/span><br>Holy magic is just the magic God uses. It kills the undead because God wants everything to stay dead forever.","time":1789782342,"resto":747988798},{"no":747992965,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:46","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989525\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989525<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747989793\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989793<\/a><br>He got permission from your landlord","time":1789782346,"resto":747988798}],"last_modified":1789782346},{"no":747915189,"now":"09\/17\/2