t;Do not be sorry, be.. BETTER.<\/span><br><br>What the fuck does this mean","filename":"1757148555593096","ext":".jpg","w":960,"h":540,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":140,"tim":1789766916795806,"time":1789766916,"md5":"RFBQ09asPYPabpl48RqzsA==","fsize":134596,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"do-not-be-sorry-be-better","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":161,"images":18,"omitted_posts":156,"omitted_images":18,"last_replies":[{"no":747992368,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:33:59","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747979178\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747979178<\/a><br>It means grow a beard.<br>Adopt a small californian boy and make him live with you in the forest.<br>Let your wife walk all over you and fuck other men.<br>Order &quot;The Mummy&quot; special edition on bluray.<br>Wear a baby yoda t-shirt and go to starbucks every saturday.<br>Get a &quot;doggo&quot; and post photos of it on facebook.<br>Travel to japan.<br>Subscribe to Apple TV and Spotify and Premium Youtube.","time":1789781639,"resto":747979178},{"no":747992446,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:35:19","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992368\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992368<\/a><br>I forgot<br>*use an air fryer and talk about how much you love it","time":1789781719,"resto":747979178},{"no":747992628,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:49","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747979178\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747979178<\/a><br>are you a different animal and the same beast","time":1789781929,"resto":747979178},{"no":747992686,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:10","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747979178\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747979178<\/a><br>I just finished God of War Ragnarok, and instead of saying that the game is amazing (it is), I will talk about what I felt while wrapping up the story. We must be better. This is the moral I felt the game was conveying. And it hit my feelings so hard thanks to this great acting from every actors, and this amazing realization. While being a completely made up story from Norse mythology, it felt so grounded to earth and our actual situation as humans. Odin being a political businessman, getting the most out of everyone without caring for anyone\u2019s feelings, getting as much ressources from every realms as possible without caring for the consequences, lying and having no moral just to \u201clook good\u201d. This depicts our politicians and leaders so well. Kratos, Athreus and their friends fighting for a better world, defending their ideas and other people. All of this while trying not to do the same mistakes, even if this makes them lose (die). We must be better, we must stand up for our world, we must fight for our dying earth, we must defend those in needs, we must work so our children can enjoy this amazing world. This is crazy that a game makes me worship a non existing character more than our actual leaders\/politicians. Thanks for reading, I wanted to share how this game hit my feelings and my ideas of our actual world. And if you feel the same, please share this message, we must be better, because if we are not, there will be no more world to share to our children.","time":1789782010,"resto":747979178},{"no":747992963,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:45","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747983010\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747983010<\/a><br>oh yeah we don&#039;t the kid becoming a literal God or something.","time":1789782345,"resto":747979178}],"last_modified":1789782345},{"no":747955634,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)11:25:26","name":"Anonymous","sub":"[DEVASTATING NEWS]","com":"JAPANESE PLAYERS HATE THE NEW FIRE EMBLEM GAME<br>https:\/\/pug.5ch.io\/test\/read.cgi\/ga<wbr>merpg\/1789722993\/l50","filename":"1763156384658962","ext":".png","w":1216,"h":10000,"tn_w":30,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789745126049604,"time":1789745126,"md5":"ln1HLd9QpvDq5hq6mJelNg==","fsize":3317792,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"devastating-news","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":384,"images":59,"omitted_posts":379,"omitted_images":58,"last_replies":[{"no":747992917,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:44:53","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747955634\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747955634<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747955739\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747955739<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747955754\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747955754<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747955813\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747955813<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;jap snoyfags flaseflagging as longtime FE fans<\/span><br>lol","time":1789782293,"resto":747955634},{"no":747992921,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:44:57","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;they made the game Blacker than Natlan<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;even though it&#039;s based on the Roman Empire<\/span>","filename":"1786839958066347","ext":".png","w":680,"h":677,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":124,"tim":1789782297739746,"time":1789782297,"md5":"Ni+0Oz0owyyE5jl06cHJ4A==","fsize":446016,"resto":747955634},{"no":747992949,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:26","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992714\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992714<\/a><br>Probably more from dragon madness but it&#039;s still retarded that things got that fucking bad with Sothis","time":1789782326,"resto":747955634},{"no":747992958,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:35","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992662\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992662<\/a><br>Why did you post this literal clown?","time":1789782335,"resto":747955634},{"no":747992961,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:40","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992773\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992773<\/a><br>Good thing they scrapped the eight lords setting, even though two of them are filler.","time":1789782340,"resto":747955634}],"last_modified":1789782340},{"no":747915862,"now":"09\/17\/26(Thu)20:20:27","name":"Anonymous","sub":"\/v\/ the Musical XIV","com":"\/v\/ The Musical XIV Druid Edition<br><br>Last Thread: <a href=\"\/v\/thread\/747826924#p747826924\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747826924<\/a><br>Tutorial: https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=szo<wbr>luCoZmBg<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;What is this?<\/span><br>An annual collaboration project where \/v\/ sings about video games for a full month, from September 15 through October 15. We&#039;ve had a strong start, keep the momentum up!<br><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;How do I contribute?<\/span><br>Write something and post it in thread and in the Song Spreadsheet once it&#039;s set up! Or look in the thread or Spreadsheet for something to sing or edit. Album art is always welcome, too! And you can even make videos for the songs that are already made! We especially need editors this year!<br><br>General Links<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Song Spreadsheet<\/span><br>https:\/\/docs.google.com\/spreadsheet<wbr>s\/d\/1d43M5I8X5zOwh92zZEplrtxxMmFr-Q<wbr>zIu8M9eJoqoBk<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Songs that are already done<\/span><br>https:\/\/docs.google.com\/spreadsheet<wbr>s\/d\/16rgydhRgtfhrkW3lQwLSyjuS5INyFn<wbr>d5hVvWx31JW00<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;NEWFAQ<\/span><br>https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/<wbr>1QwgjGUjVfgURMBAQZbcuRdBH0GK50I3edg<wbr>0bxetXeCg<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Art Folder<\/span><br>https:\/\/drive.google.com\/drive\/fold<wbr>ers\/1Oxq_sNYzscGwh25RLlwURFPeqhC0Lk<wbr>oM<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Instrumental database<\/span><br>https:\/\/docs.google.com\/spreadsheet<wbr>s\/d\/1wMoG5tvsVvHD4J5J9SbDIJzXBqKq5U<wbr>u90-TWtsjSvIc<br>Contains 4000+ instrumentals made from original studio recordings and 74000+ karaoke tracks.<br>If you need a song from the database, simply tag your post with [VINST] so we can easily find it<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;proper mic technique<\/span><br>www.youtube.com\/watch?v=sr8c5sgkkvc<wbr> <br>Where can I listen to the songs?<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Web Player<\/span><br>vthemusical.stfweb.lv<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Latest videos<\/span><br>www.youtube.com\/playlist?list=PLAX8<wbr>JHUJcFR2gh_WG3YJBITuO-tODVCcJ<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Site with songs from previous years (RIP Bandcamp and Voombox)<\/span><br>https:\/\/vthemusical.neocities.org","filename":"literallyme","ext":".jpg","w":2000,"h":2000,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789690827475869,"time":1789690827,"md5":"RlPmZFCN+eLQVne\/dpXNtg==","fsize":582279,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"v-the-musical-xiv","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":482,"images":107,"omitted_posts":477,"omitted_images":106,"last_replies":[{"no":747992653,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:39:15","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992024\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992024<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;AI is dogshit at niche writing, it doesn&#039;t truly get \/v\/ culture<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;AI is typically neutered to refuse to break copyright, you can&#039;t even get it to bring up the lyrics of a song most of the time let alone edit them<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;If you get AI to break copyright it can&#039;t handle syllables let alone stresses most of the time, even ignoring words that it doesn&#039;t get because they&#039;re only understood by autists. <\/span><br><br>I mean yeah in theory someone can tell AI to write their song, but it&#039;s probably more work to take that output and convert it into something even remotely usable than it is to just take the existing lyrics of the original song and then tweak those.<br><br>If there are submitted songs that are clearly AI nobody is stopping you from pointing it out. Realistically though it&#039;s pointless, AI lyrics would just end up rotting unsung because they&#039;ll be soulless shit. We have to gatekeep AI singers and artists because their output actually ends up in our final product outside of situations album art needing a poll.","filename":"vidya","ext":".png","w":854,"h":384,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":56,"tim":1789781955054827,"time":1789781955,"md5":"HVj+jB0kuzDb+h6sXojfNQ==","fsize":27998,"resto":747915862},{"no":747992694,"now":"09\/1