 you&#039;re going to be constantly gaining points, getting moved up higher and higher, closer and closer to the sweat hellscape. I&#039;d just wait for the Festivals, see what the next patch has to offer, and go from there.","time":1789781418,"resto":747913816},{"no":747992365,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:33:55","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992204\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992204<\/a><br>Sucks they never thought to create a separate ranked queue with how railroaded ranked progression is. Hopefully there&#039;s another festival soon because the game is really fun. It&#039;d be cool to run private lobbies on \/v\/eekends when there isn&#039;t a festival up so we can avoid all the bullshit and still play the game.","time":1789781635,"resto":747913816},{"no":747992630,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:49","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747914463\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747914463<\/a><br>cute brows","time":1789781929,"resto":747913816},{"no":747992768,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:03","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992365\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992365<\/a><br>My theory I&#039;ve had for most of the game&#039;s lifespan at this point is just that Sega doesn&#039;t give a shit about their casual players. Why bother making a separate matchmaking queue when you don&#039;t care about the players who want it anyway?","time":1789782123,"resto":747913816},{"no":747992928,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:04","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;that futa rei x asuka doujin where they marry and impregnate each other<\/span><br>hhhhhnnnnnnggggg myyyy cookkkkkkk","time":1789782304,"resto":747913816}],"last_modified":1789782304},{"no":747939028,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)05:22:04","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Limbus","com":"Discuss whatever the fuck happened in the new chapter along with this ID<br>https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=GIe<wbr>7Fna5LD4","filename":"1769874444463277","ext":".png","w":2071,"h":2854,"tn_w":181,"tn_h":250,"tim":178