:19,"tim":1789779084902613,"time":1789779084,"md5":"BFpyjNgU4nMYmVukqBW2Mw==","fsize":68897,"resto":747984209},{"no":747990404,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:55:34","name":"Anonymous","com":"None of their games are amazing, but they make consistently above average games that are niche and refuse to fully adopt mainstream, normalfag elements. Don&#039;t like the open world of Nioh 3\/Wo long 2 though. <br><br>Also their engine sucks and their last few releases have been technical disasters.","time":1789779334,"resto":747984209},{"no":747990874,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:03:50","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747984209\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747984209<\/a><br>they have basically kept alive an alternate lineage of old style action games that are more post ninja gaiden than post-souls. anything &quot;soulsy&quot; about them was already present in ninja gaiden 1. most importantly they never went down the dark path of designing combat around i-frame windows and rhythm game timing<br>and they&#039;re still willing to iterate and ship lots of games even if they&#039;re 7-8 out of 10.<br>fromsoft seems to have fallen into a period of paralysis caused by hype and investor money inflows, where anything that isn&#039;t an 11\/10 flagship or live-service cashcow simply isn&#039;t going to get made, even if they have the illusion of creative independence","time":1789779830,"resto":747984209},{"no":747991131,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:09:25","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989396\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989396<\/a><br>Nah DW as a whole is under omega force BUT they did better optimization for Katana engine in DW:O","time":1789780165,"resto":747984209},{"no":747992892,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:44:25","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747987898\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987898<\/a><br>When people talk about how Dark Souls killed action games Team Ninja is what comes to my mind. Total loss of soul here","time":1789782265,"resto":747984209}],"last_modifi