,"resto":747971273},{"no":747992767,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:01","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747971273\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747971273<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;I hate this movie cause it&#039;s nothing like Resident Evil<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;It doesn&#039;t follow the story or canon<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Cheap jumpscares everywhere<\/span><br>Yet these are the same people who think RE2 remake is the best resident evil ever, a game that ruined the fucking lore and change characters personalities and shit.<br><br>I fucking hate you nu fags so fucking much","filename":"Screenshot 2026-06-28 203152","ext":".png","w":706,"h":613,"tn_w":124,"tn_h":108,"tim":1789782121470408,"time":1789782121,"md5":"EA\/5CnOllV80gtGas78zWQ==","fsize":260815,"resto":747971273},{"no":747992839,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:43:20","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990819\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990819<\/a><br>Jill has to sit in my top ten list for perfect casting choice.","time":1789782200,"resto":747971273},{"no":747992863,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:43:57","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992059\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992059<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747971814\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747971814<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747986369\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747986369<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747989490\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989490<\/a><br>You literally just described every resident evil game 7 onwards","time":1789782237,"resto":747971273}],"last_modified":1789782237},{"no":747990253,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:52:58","name":"Anonymous","com":"Swap a few games and this list is close to how I feel","filename":"1717547950205","ext":".jpg","w":709,"h":393,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":138,"tim":1789779178195195,"time":1789779178,"md5":"0XPT94Q+BF4+Nx7HlOcj\/A==","fsize":129221,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"swap-a-few-games-and-this-list-is-close-to-how-i","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":24,"images":8,"omitted_posts":19,"omitted_images":7,"last_replies":[{"no":747992616,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:33","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992316\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992316<\/a><br>I&#039;ve been a TOTK hater from day because it&#039;s so obvious the game was meant to be a DLC since it&#039;s 90% the same game and content and what was added is so shoehorned and just hastily placed it makes no sens and the whole game is a chore.<br><br>People think all it takes to get a GOTY is being able to build your own motorcycle when that&#039;s only fun the first time and a chore every time after. The sky islands add nothing of value and for a game that expects you to juggle a lot of materials, the UI sucks.<br><br>But yeah, at least having actual dungeons was better but sadly that doesn&#039;t save this game. I hate seeing people treating this as a perfect videogame because that&#039;s just the Nintendo Bonus + Zelda Bonus. It&#039;s amazing how people treat Zelda as this near perfectly flawless franchise that can do no wrong and god forbid you criticize it.","time":1789781913,"resto":747990253},{"no":747992620,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:37","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992119\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992119<\/a><br>Oh I put Skyward Sword in C tier. Well you know what it deserves it for that shadow monster boss that you have to drive stakes into its head","time":1789781917,"resto":747990253},{"no":747992723,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:53","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990253\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990253<\/a><br>here is mine, twilling princess was my first zelda so i will always have a special place in my heart for it, the rest are the one I have played ever since","filename":"tierlist","ext":".png","w":1140,"h":461,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":50,"tim":1789782053995476,"time":1789782053,"md5":"CJu7ZwE4KfRFCiCkhah2sg==","fsize":414371,"resto":747990253},{"no":747992780,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:18","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a h