},{"no":747992816,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:43:02","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747980958\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747980958<\/a><br>Thirr valley, the river south of vivec is where stuff is leveled for early game, don&#039;t hesitate to leave old ebonheart","time":1789782182,"resto":747980958}],"last_modified":1789782182},{"no":747992436,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:35:05","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Today, eight years ago N1RV Ann-A was announced","com":"Sukeban Games, one of the most based and redpilled developers today, announced it saying it would come out in 2020 for PC, Mac, PlayStation 4 and Nintendo Switch.<br>As you can guess, the game entered development hell and in the meantime Christopher Ortiz (the artist of VA-11 Hall-A) started creating .45 PARABELLUM BLOODHOUND, without any involvement from Fernando Damas (writer of VA-11 Hall-A) and is expected to come out this year.","filename":"__jill_stingray_and_sam_va_11_hall_a_and_1_more_drawn_by_moonface__fe17a9107b35c1a12adbfab8d81ba0f2","ext":".jpg","w":2480,"h":3508,"tn_w":176,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789781705447074,"time":1789781705,"md5":"LSv+zJyvJUEByxLNg1DeeQ==","fsize":2112067,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"today-eight-years-ago-n1rv-anna-was-announced","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":6,"images":1,"omitted_posts":1,"omitted_images":0,"last_replies":[{"no":747992597,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:12","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992436\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992436<\/a><br>any details on what happened?","time":1789781892,"resto":747992436},{"no":747992691,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:12","name":"Anonymous","com":"I doubt that it&#039;ll ever happen, and even if it does happen, it&#039;ll be a shadow of what it could have been. All we have is their other project, which thankfully looks pretty good.","time":1789782012,"resto":747992436},{"no":747992719,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:50","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992691\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992691<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;t. kiririn51<\/span>","time":1789782050,"resto":747992436},{"no":747992813,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:58","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992719\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992719<\/a><br>I really have to cope and say that if I support their other game that maybe they&#039;ll go back to NIRV Ann-A. just let me live in my cope fantasy.","filename":"1549184724170","ext":".jpg","w":500,"h":522,"tn_w":119,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789782178626841,"time":1789782178,"md5":"q7J5OpX+EH8ZGAR\/T5XCSQ==","fsize":36899,"resto":747992436},{"no":747992915,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:44:49","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992597\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992597<\/a><br>The writer and codemonkey of the first game got burned up and got mogged in his coding work by a freelancer.<br>https:\/\/sukeban.moe\/index.php\/2020\/<wbr>12\/01\/nirvana-delay-en\/<br>Ortiz got tired of waiting, and started working on a passion project of their own, and won&#039;t start working on the sequel until this new passion project is out.","time":1789782289,"resto":747992436}],"last_modified":1789782289},{"no":747951395,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)10:10:47","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;you let a man \u201cescape\u201d after winning an honorable duel <\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;he was not only a Jarl of Skyrim but a war veteran <\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;your punishment is being executed in public while people throw fruit at your beheaded corpse and your body is thrown in the sewer<\/span>","filename":"SR-npc-Roggvir","ext":".png","w":1080,"h":1080,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789740647520220,"time":1789740647,"md5":"hN2sKQuZjo2NWuX3f3solw==","fsize":2157707,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"you-let-a-man-escape-after-winning-an-honorable","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":332,"images":55,"omitted_posts":327,"omitted_images":54,"last_replies":[{"no":747989986,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:47:49","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989603\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989603<\/a><br>Let&#039;s say that he is from Alcaire, how does that invalidate the claim that he&#039;s a nord?","time":1789778869,"resto":747951395},{"no":747990021,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:48:25","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988094\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988094<\/a><br>Jurgen Windcaller is apparently correct, if the conversation you have with him in Sovngarde is to be believed. The Greybeards can&#039;t do what Ulfric did if they want to gain access to Sovngarde through wisdom and greater understanding of the Thu&#039;um, BUT it does raise the question of how the rest of the Nords allowed this ancient and storied magical art unique to themselves just disappear from the rest of the populace.","time":1789778905,"resto":747951395},{"no":747990151,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:51:06","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989986\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989986<\/a><br>by itself it doesn&#039;t, the part I&#039;ve been replying to is the idea that he isn&#039;t from High Mutt<br>all we have to go on for his actual race are his name(s) and his appearance in Redguard","filename":"RG-scene-Introduction_16","ext":".jpg","w":1024,"h":768,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":93,"tim":1789779066242715,"time":1789779066,"md5":"bLcz3hKTVw+oQiTIWYrqeA==","fsize":183252,"resto":747951395},{"no":747990280,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:53:30","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990151\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990151<\/a><br>Fine. I&#039;m willingly to meet in the middle. Tiber Septim was a nord from High Mutt.","time":1789779210,"resto":747951395},{"no":747992812,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:57","name":"Chillrend","com":"<a href=\"#p747989615\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989615<\/a><br>By not making another game Todd has given me a lot of time to think about this issue.<br><br><a href=\"#p747990021\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990021<\/a><br>But you forget that both Ulfric and Torygg also made it to Sovengarde. They died in combat, therefore &quot;honoring&quot; the nord traditions. If anything, the fact that the greybeards are still on the line shows that their path is misguided. Shor is a warrior god, not a &quot;chill on top of a mountain and refuse to fight for your people&quot; god.<br><br><a href=\"#p747989564\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989564<\/a><br>People love to overlook this part. The Empire is a dog that the Thalmor has already pried the teeth out of. They forced the emperor and the previous high king of Skyrim to execute their surviving elite military unit. They demanded the empire renounce their founder and culture. On top of that, they have given themselves the authority to roam the lands, taking any citizen at will and executing them. In Skyrim alone the Thalmor not only have an embassy that we visit during the main quest, but a small palace in Solitude right next to the Emperors &quot;visiting&quot; castle that for some reason the main quest never takes us to. &quot;We should continue to let the defeated subservient losers rule over us, because maybe one day they will grow a spine and rebel&quot; is a pathetic mindset, and says more about the people arguing for it than any in game decision ever could.<br><br>Unless you just like the Roman aesthetic. In which case, based.","time":1789782177,"resto":747951395,"trip":"!!dzf+xl20FFs"}],"last_modified":1789782177},{"no":747926873,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)00:04:41","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Fairy Friday","com":"Three slices of the Bratty fairy type companion, choose.","filename":"__star_sapphire_sunny_milk_and_luna_child_touhou_drawn_by_baba_baba_seimaijo__a2a4516697d7970fd6cafd82bfe2e5bb","ext":".jpg","w":1547,"h":2436,"tn_w":158,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789704281334464,"time":1789704281,"md5":"eIlaPFjGBIFeAcsKSdiGug==","fsize":574472,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"fairy-friday","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":291,"images":169,"omitte