n_h":187,"tim":1789761498062811,"time":1789761498,"md5":"PqmzTy0bkTGS58v5fsWvnQ==","fsize":21199,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"install-linux","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":251,"images":45,"omitted_posts":246,"omitted_images":44,"last_replies":[{"no":747991945,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:25:27","name":"Anonymous","com":"I want to move to CachyOS or Linux at least soon<br><br>What exactly do I do if I have a Razer Naga v3 (MMO mouse with 12 side buttons)<br><br>It seems that Razer needed to change buttons\/macros software doesn&#039;t run on linux","filename":"1739228208573548","ext":".jpg","w":750,"h":688,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":114,"tim":1789781127166384,"time":1789781127,"md5":"lkmvT5nbeGtcmHtxFJih4A==","fsize":417616,"resto":747973695},{"no":747992143,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:29:07","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991945\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991945<\/a><br>you can just google things<br>https:\/\/openrazer.github.io\/","time":1789781347,"resto":747973695},{"no":747992240,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:58","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991945\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991945<\/a><br>I used to use a razer mouse and play wow on linux, base settings worked fine for me. If you need to change buttons I&#039;m assuming you&#039;re using a Naga and I believe openrazer supports those.","time":1789781458,"resto":747973695},{"no":747992356,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:33:45","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747980256\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747980256<\/a><br>Nigger I&#039;ve never had that shit work on windows.","time":1789781625,"resto":747973695},{"no":747992808,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:52","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747973695\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747973695<\/a><br>This is great but as someone who honestly plays less vidya nowadays and now writes dumb stories and ERPs as a main hobby instead I am thinking of switching back to Mint a month or so after the new major version releases. CachyOS does not install with language components\/modules\/whatever which are needed for Libre Office to fully function. Although I was able to fix this by just looking up what was needed and installing them myself just missing something that feels like it should be part of a minimum standard feels iffy.","time":1789782172,"resto":747973695}],"last_modified":1789782172},{"no":747964449,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)13:41:02","name":"Anonymous","com":"WOW Forever is amazing, AMAZING. Walked into the harbor at sunset. Had to stop and just sit down. There&#039;s like 40 people gathered here now. I don&#039;t even have words, I started to even tear up.","filename":"yq56ik0g07qh1","ext":".png","w":2538,"h":1432,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":141,"tim":1789753262697135,"time":1789753262,"md5":"HNDZlEpr4uSDQDLmtNHN9g==","fsize":3949115,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"wow-forever-is-amazing-amazing-walked-into-the","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":200,"images":25,"omitted_posts":195,"omitted_images":25,"last_replies":[{"no":747991973,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:26:01","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990336\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990336<\/a><br>you can just chargeback through your bank if you want if it ever goes beyond some return window","time":1789781161,"resto":747964449},{"no":747992487,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:36:17","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991502\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991502<\/a><br>Never too late, I guess.<br>I can understand playing mmos if you have friends in those games but otherwise nah.","time":1789781777,"resto":747964449},{"no":747992627,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:49","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747964449\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747964449<\/a><br>I miss when people kept their mid-life crisis to themselves.","time":1789781929,"resto":747964449},{"no":747992636,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:51","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747968681\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747968681<\/a><br>Offsite I&#039;ve noticed they genuinely have critical thinking skill issues and cannot into abstraction.<br>In a related example, I&#039;ve actually seen zoomers ask what something means to be &#039;reddit&#039; and I honestly can&#039;t tell if it&#039;s bots, an attempt at playing dumb to reverse psychology calling something reddit into not being derogatory or an even poorer attempt to embarrass the person saying it, or they flat out cannot contextually parse the meaning when something is excessively politically correct\/woke\/etc, that that&#039;s reddits bread and butter.<br><br>This goes for a lot of similar situations, which is wild considering they come up with new retarded ebonic phrases every week and can remember those just fine until they&#039;re overused and buried in a month.","time":1789781931,"resto":747964449},{"no":747992807,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:42:47","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747969268\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747969268<\/a><br>yep, cause they fucking lost the classic source code","time":1789782167,"resto":747964449}],"last_modified":1789782167},{"no":747991374,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:13:48","name":"Anonymous","com":"Team Green always wins","filename":"wardogs-1770339684950","ext":".jpg","w":1024,"h":1024,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789780428876670,"time":1789780428,"md5":"FzE9CH1eukSQiU9U+58HRw==","fsize":243292,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"team-green-always-wins","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":5,"images":2,"last_replies":[{"no":747991641,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:19:30","name":"Anonymous","com":"Can we not","time":1789780770,"resto":747991374},{"no":747992074,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:27:52","name":"Anonymous","com":"Was there any ever doubt?","time":1789781272,"resto":747991374},{"no":747992134,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:28:53","name":"Anonymous","filename":"6c0","ext":".png","w":1378,"h":2039,"tn_w":84,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789781333108045,"time":1789781333,"md5":"R5APT9OoC42FFeP4ptALxA==","fsize":473835,"resto":747991374