 same.<br>So what ended up happening is the Malayan studio delivered all they were tasked to do but the Blizzard guys were understaffed and totally fumbled it. So they got layed off. <br><br>You&#039;re seeing it in real time. <br>You can <br>A ) Hire &quot;Indians&quot;(just foreigners in general) at 70% of normal wages but have them work 130% output under threat of deportation if they don&#039;t meet quotas.<br>B ) Move studios over to other countries Ubisoft is a master of this they collect local benefits from &quot;art&quot; or &quot;employment&quot; schemes by the goverments trying to push into IT so you have Ubisoft Bluebyte, Ubisoft Berlin, Ubisoft Meinz, Ubisoft Bucharest, Ubisoft Kiyv, Ubisoft Milan, Ubisoft Odeas, Ubisoft Stockholm, Ubisoft Abu Dhabi, Ubisoft Da Nag, Ubisoft Mombai, Ubisoft Pune, Ubisoft Philipiens, Ubisoft Shanghai, Ubisoft Singapoure, Ubisoft Pune, Ubisoft Toronto, Ubisoft Quebec, Ubisoft Osaka, Ubisoft Belgrade, Ubisoft Sao Paolo<br>C ) Outsource some stuff, most of them do this","time":1789781649,"resto":747963559},{"no":747992516,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:36:48","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747963559\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747963559<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;4chan thread of a twitter screencap of a reddit post<\/span>","filename":"godbert stop","ext":".jpg","w":200,"h":200,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789781808171828,"time":1789781808,"md5":"tx7aBqTIZyTYN7G2aessew==","fsize":8822,"resto":747963559},{"no":747992752,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:41:43","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990735\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990735<\/a><br>Does anyone have a time line on these?<br>The first woke games I remember were Dragon Age 2 followed by Mass Effect Andromeda they were quite literally the start of the Ugly Female and Purple Colors shit.<br><br>It seems Mass Effect Andromeda is the pantient zero of it all. Ugly Females, Lesbian Buzzcut, Purple color fag, nigger dead headcut, everyones some sort of non straigh