ier<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;BOTW<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;TOTK<\/span><br>shit tier<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;SS<\/span>","time":1789776242,"resto":747984206},{"no":747987936,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:07:15","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747987778\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987778<\/a><br>That&#039;s fair","time":1789776435,"resto":747984206},{"no":747988939,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:26:52","name":"Anonymous","com":"I got Wind Waker HD thanks to a Wii U promo, I remember liking the controls, the aesthetics and the story. But I didn&#039;t enjoyed it as much as OoT or MM due to the lack of content and the dungeons being downgraded compared to the previous entries. Wish the game had two more dungeons or maybe a couple of more sidequests","time":1789777612,"resto":747984206},{"no":747990698,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:00:45","name":"Anonymous","com":"Speaking of TP, the PC port Dusklight just updated to 2.0 with mod support and a randomizer.<br>https:\/\/github.com\/TwilitRealm\/dusk<wbr>light\/releases\/tag\/v2.0.0","time":1789779645,"resto":747984206},{"no":747992713,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:45","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747985307\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747985307<\/a><br>TP is pretty. I really like the dark fantasy art style it has desu","filename":"1542555598708","ext":".jpg","w":3000,"h":1689,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":70,"tim":1789782045922778,"time":1789782045,"md5":"fuN4kbt67SrQ4RzodIJneA==","fsize":3641312,"resto":747984206,"m_img":1}],"last_modified":1789782045},{"no":747992506,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:36:37","name":"Anonymous","com":"This image is a complete lie. <br>A schoolyard rumor that is in fact official art.<br><br>But they have the chance to make it real.<br>Will they?<br>FF7R did, with shit like this.","filename":"Link_and_Sheik_Battle_Ganondorf_2527s_Hordes","ext":".jpg","w":1884,"h":2500,"tn_w":188,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789781797604982,"time":1789781797,"md5":"wrRMn54mL1jKd5HQj8QNcQ==","fsize":1537199,"resto":0