elink\">&gt;&gt;747990827<\/a><br>Solo Devs of games that just launched don&#039;t have time to sit around here and bump threads and bicker with morons like you. They have to work around the clock on bug fixes and updates to norm-ify the game as quickly as possible. Bosses don&#039;t just nerf themselves.","time":1789780630,"resto":747970858},{"no":747991743,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:21:27","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991521\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991521<\/a><br>Skeletons work like a wack ass version of selkies (or some werewolf variants) where they can take off their skin<br>Alice might still have her skin, but if you&#039;re not careful you can outgrow it (like what happened with Hans) or many skeletons donate their skin when they want to give up humanity completely (random Edwin dialogue)<br>So maybe?","time":1789780887,"resto":747970858},{"no":747992237,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:57","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991410\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991410<\/a><br>I tried that, and veggies, and mead, and raw hay. Nothing. Maybe its a bug?","time":1789781457,"resto":747970858},{"no":747992361,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:33:49","name":"Anonymous","com":"I accidentally planted two creature clusters because at the time I didn&#039;t know what I was doing. How can I get rid of one?","filename":"11194","ext":".jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":70,"tim":1789781629830623,"time":1789781629,"md5":"XGFLSXVwNc3THIFrRS20iA==","fsize":554894,"resto":747970858,"m_img":1},{"no":747992705,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:31","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988917\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988917<\/a><br>How does Blorph kiss with no lips?","filename":"11048","ext":".jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":70,"tim":1789782031314141,"time":1789782031,"md5":"jyr57mmwyMDHkR42HyC5Ww==","fsize":331652,"resto":747970858,"m_img":1}],"last_modified":1789782031},{"no":747956576,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)11:41:51","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Bl