ard by people like Jarl Balgruuf and Eorland Greymane.<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Part of the process of getting in their inner circle includes becoming a werewolf<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Eorland in fact totally knows about this since he shows up in the cave to give you the completed axe.<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;said transformation involves you transforming right inside Whiterun and you are encouraged to try your new form....by running around the city and slaughtering Whiterun&#039;s guards and citizens.<\/span><br><br>Uh....huh.","filename":"SR-creature-Werewolf_03","ext":".jpg","w":755,"h":755,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789748708840005,"time":1789748708,"md5":"\/UAPBJ4ucxYbQWqRG00joQ==","fsize":322436,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"join-the-companions-a-respected-old-group-in","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":188,"images":21,"omitted_posts":183,"omitted_images":21,"last_replies":[{"no":747990207,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:52:08","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989598\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989598<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;make dealings with daedra<\/span><br>Nothing wrong with that. Daedra worship is legal and was common throughout history.","time":1789779128,"resto":747959239},{"no":747991937,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:25:22","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988901\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988901<\/a><br>The Elder Scrolls games use unreliable narrators, so if you see a book written by an Imperial scholar with a bias and a motive to smear Ulfric it&#039;s probably a little untrue, yes. You can see in-game how monstrous the Forsworn are, and that&#039;s enough to put the lie on the guy claiming they were peaceful and didn&#039;t treat the Nords they had just raided like shit.","time":1789781122,"resto":747959239},{"no":747992284,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:32:07","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991937\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991937<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;it&#039;s all fake<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;all the lore written in the games is fake<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;unless it supports my side<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;then it&#039;s real<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Ulfric was a good boy<\/span><br>Okay, bro.","time":1789781527,"resto":747959239},{"no":747992463,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:35:45","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992284\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992284<\/a><br>Not all of it, just this specific example where some random Imperial toady that&#039;s never been to the province is going<br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;akshually those marauding rapist bandits that you can see committing human sacrifice and cavorting with evil hags with your own eyes are good boys and Ulfric was a dickhead for stopping them from slaughtering the citizens the Empire failed to protect<\/span>","time":1789781745,"resto":747959239},{"no":747992684,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:40:08","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747992463\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747992463<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;everything written in the game is real<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;except this one thing<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;this one singular thing is fake because it makes Ulfric look bad<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Ulfric was a good boy<\/span><br>...sure, bro.","time":1789782008,"resto":747959239}],"last_modified":1789782008},{"no":747985664,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)19:23:23","name":"Anonymous","com":"COSMO WANDA<br>I WISH FOR AA VIDEOGAMES TO BE MAINSTREAM AGAIN","filename":"Fair","ext":".jpg","w":640,"h":908,"tn_w":176,"tn_h":249,"tim":1789773803554526,"time":1789773803,"md5":"v28Xa+duOwarCPstZAAPeg==","fsize":114430,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"cosmo-wanda","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":40,"images":17,"omitted_posts":35,"omitted_images":16,"last_replies":[{"no":747992114,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:28:31","name":"Anonymous","com":"