orrectly, to pretty much the same quality as an oven or pan but with much less time spent and no hassle.","time":1789781916,"resto":747936274}],"last_modified":1789781916},{"no":747987412,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)19:56:32","name":"Anonymous","com":"This is literally just Mexican Miku. How do people masturbate to this?","filename":"miku","ext":".jpg","w":1080,"h":1039,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":240,"tim":1789775792054596,"time":1789775792,"md5":"\/2OgIdVIYc9YM8rQG\/xGkg==","fsize":515619,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"this-is-literally-just-mexican-miku-how-do-people","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":17,"images":4,"omitted_posts":12,"omitted_images":2,"last_replies":[{"no":747991657,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:19:56","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747987412\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987412<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Game is so boring even \/v\/ threads stopped<\/span><br>God damn did this bomb","time":1789780796,"resto":747987412},{"no":747991696,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:20:41","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747987412\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987412<\/a><br>Nothing about her features look mexican","time":1789780841,"resto":747987412},{"no":747991756,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:21:48","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;Canas: \u201cFascinating.\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Guy: \u201cWhat?\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Canas: \u201cOne word possesses both a proper and common-noun meaning.\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Saddam: \u201cThat&#039;s what I&#039;ve been saying, guy.\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Guy: \u201cDon&#039;t encourage him.\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Canas: \u201cPerhaps context determines the intended meaning.\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Saddam: \u201cExactly, guy.\u201d<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Guy: \u201cTHERE IS NEVER ANY CONTEXT.\u201d<\/span>","filename":"1778514503350475m","ext":".jpg"