ntal illness","time":1789780329,"resto":747986269},{"no":747991281,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:12:13","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747987098\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987098<\/a><br>just send the mp3 file to trainerabu and he&#039;ll add it","time":1789780333,"resto":747986269},{"no":747991332,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:13:05","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990235\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990235<\/a><br>if true: dalokah&#039;s bar, natascha, buffalo steak sandwich","time":1789780385,"resto":747986269},{"no":747991357,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:13:30","name":"Anonymous","com":"15 prisoners celebrating koth_sawdust_festive_b1","time":1789780410,"resto":747986269},{"no":747992605,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:24","name":"Anonymous","com":"20 players living their best life on koth_watermill_final","time":1789781904,"resto":747986269}],"last_modified":1789781904}]},{"page":6,"threads":[{"no":747981930,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)18:16:54","name":"Anonymous","sub":"STOP! TELL ME WHAT YOU PLAYED THIS WEEK! AND LAST WEEK!","com":"OR YOU&#039;RE A FAGGOT!<br><br>I&#039;ve recently been getting back in Killzone 2&#039;s multiplayer. Better than I expected, going to try out Resistance: Fall of Man&#039;s multiplayer when I have the chance. Still playing WET, a year later. You should all try Dante&#039;s Inferno, it&#039;s really good. Same with Dead Space if you hadn&#039;t already, as I like to think they&#039;re free games since you can easily set up RPCS3 and hop right in. <br><br>Sad we never got to see more of Lotton the Wizard in BL, loved that guy.","filename":"whitelagoon","ext":".jpg","w":1100,"h":618,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":140,"tim":1789769814708205,"time":1789769814,"md5":"Mr\/WEW1eWl5ORXDFFdJ7Rg==","fsize":67291,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"stop-tell-me-what-you-played-this-week-and-last","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":51,"images":12,"omitted_posts":46,"omitted_images":11,"last_replies":[{"no":747992385,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:34:19","name":"DrewXRubi","com":"<a href=\"#p747981930\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747981930<\/a><br>I played just a bit of WET, myself, on Tuesday. To commemorate both the anniversary of when the game came out (in 2009) and when i first played it (in 2020). Also, glad you enjoy Dante\u2019s Inferno. That one\u2019s an underrated gem.","time":1789781659,"resto":747981930},{"no":747992406,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:34:38","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991145\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991145<\/a><br>aaaaaaand its all over my screen","time":1789781678,"resto":747981930},{"no":747992569,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:37:43","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747981930\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747981930<\/a><br>Just finished NG4 and i&#039;m plenty pleased with it. I was a bit unsure when i started because it felt nothing like 2 or 3RE, but i mellowed to it. It&#039;s more platinum than TN but i still think it&#039;s an 8\/10 game. It&#039;s not erratic like 2 or is a salvagement like 3re. It really feels like a complete cohesive game, even if ryu only has 1 weapon. Thinking of getting the DLC if only for the extra weapon and abyssal road. <br>But yeah, liked it a lot. <br>https:\/\/youtu.be\/BsJrCNOg-G0?si=k7Z<wbr>_BDycjWMk1chZ","time":1789781863,"resto":747981930},{"no":747992581,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:37:54","name":"Anonymous","com":"Xenoblade Chronicles X Definitive Edition<br>Modded with the uncensored\/relocalization mod and my own custom music mod for the NLA and flight themes. This game is such a marvel in so many ways that its kind of insane that more people don&#039;t talk about it. Ive yet to find anything else that even remotely scratches the same itch. Really wish Monolith would create some kind of sucessor to it instead of shonen gacha slop and a game heavily ruined by over tutorialization\/hand holding (3).","filename":"xenoblade-chronicles-x-definitive-edition-skell-flight-module-3803233308","ext":".jpg","w":2160,"h":1080,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":62,"tim":1789781874372054,"time":1789781874,"md5":"rN2lSvK2FVVaUK5AuSdTPg==","fsize":428617,"resto":747981930,"m_img":1},{"no":747992591,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:38:07","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747981930\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747981930<\/a><br>Finished Dawnwalker, very good game. Also tried playing BF6 again but they somehow managed to make that even worse than it already was.","time":1789781887,"resto":747981930}],"last_modified":1789781887},{"no":747991439,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:15:08","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;nobody cares about final fantasy anymo-ACK!<\/span>","filename":"FFVII Revelation TGS2026","ext":".webm","w":720,"h":1280,"tn_w":140,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789780508442686,"time":1789780508,"md5":"wwxPbiDX4AT3BgIQajjfHw==","fsize":3539418,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"nobody-cares-about-final-fantasy-anymoack","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":9,"images":2,"omitted_posts":4,"omitted_images":1,"last_replies":[{"no":747992085,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:28:02","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991985\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991985<\/a><br>She saved Aerith","filename":"image - 2026-09-19T032744.795","ext":".jpg","w":1469,"h":1024,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":87,"tim":1789781282856951,"time":1789781282,"md5":"A74JMyGQERxrdZzsW3poYA==","fsize":465114,"resto":747991439,"m_img":1},{"no":747992202,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:16","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991698\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991698<\/a><br>Why is she dressing like a little girl?","time":1789781416,"resto":747991439},{"no":747992262,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:31:30","name":"Anonymous","com":"I see literally everyone constantly on their phone. In public, at work and people even say before bed. Exactly what the fuck are they doing? Doing anything on a small screen sucks ass, most mobile apps are complete dog shit and it gets boring after 30 minutes.","time":1789781490,"resto":747991439},{"no":747992471,"