:747991470},{"no":747992036,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:27:03","name":"Anonymous","com":"When did 4chan stop banning ESLs from making threads? Shit&#039;s so bad it&#039;s like any given hour of the day a third of the catalog is difficult to read. If you&#039;re Indian kill yourself.","time":1789781223,"resto":747991470},{"no":747992231,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:52","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;be brown<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;try to make a video game racism<\/span><br>Anyways that&#039;s weird considering white people were the only ones who could afford the new video game things up until about 10 years ago<br>How&#039;s your resold-thrice PS2 doing in the favelas of Brazil, OP?","time":1789781452,"resto":747991470}],"last_modified":1789781452},{"no":747986386,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)19:35:45","name":"Anonymous","sub":"MH Wilds DLC will satisfy people who want a challenge","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;In an interview with PC Gamer at this year&#039;s Tokyo Game Show, Monster Hunter Wilds: Ascendance director Takuro Hiraoka said Capcom&#039;s goal for the base game was to avoid driving away newer players\u2014but he&#039;s working to ensure the expansion&#039;s endgame will satisfy players who thought its approach to difficulty missed the mark.<\/span><br><br>https:\/\/www.pcgamer.com\/games\/actio<wbr>n\/players-got-better-than-we-expect<wbr>ed-monster-hunter-wilds-dlc-directo<wbr>r-says-capcom-is-retuning-its-diffi<wbr>culty-standards-for-the-expansions-<wbr>endgame\/","filename":"IMG_9671","ext":".jpg","w":828,"h":693,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":209,"tim":1789774545910661,"time":1789774545,"md5":"mmTaCZSOTJL\/cCcB+778\/g==","fsize":100928,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"mh-wilds-dlc-will-satisfy-people-who-want-a","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":29,"images":7,"omitted_posts":24,"omitted_images":5,"last_replies":[{"no":747991589,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:18:23","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747986386\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747986386<\/a><br>Maybe they shouldn&#039;t have introduced mechanics that gave every weapon, especially the ones that heavily utilized commitment, extremely easy outs and destroyed the risk\/reward of the gameplay.","filename":"1773491179037120","ext":".png","w":300,"h":300,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789780703332748,"time":1789780703,"md5":"KA1OYbYRbeJpQ9IwhGT0KQ==","fsize":151177,"resto":747986386},{"no":747991828,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:23:13","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988407\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988407<\/a><br>Why can&#039;t they just give credits for the normalfags at the end of village questline again like back then?<br>Back then that&#039;s the limit of the baby ez difficulty","time":1789780993,"resto":747986386},{"no":747992157,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:29:20","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990543\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990543<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Worlds Iceborne feels like grounded, old-school combat, because of the existence of Rise and Wilds<\/span>","filename":"MHWI-Brachydios_Blasters_Render","ext":".png","w":512,"h":512,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789781360919426,"time":1789781360,"md5":"FzQET7upgHbep8X\/+ovaaw==","fsize":53139,"resto":747986386},{"no":747992216,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:32","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747986386\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747986386<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;20 hour forced tutorial with a dog shit storyline until you get to the expansion where the actual fun begins.<\/span><br>Yeah, nah.","time":1789781432,"resto":747986386},{"no":747992505,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:36:36","name":"Anonymous","com":"Is that dev speak for &quot;we&#039;ll make the painttrail green instead of yellow&quot; or is there any chance it may mean actually challenging?","time":1789781796,"resto":747986386}],"last_modified":1789781796},{"no":747986873,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)19:45:17","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Spooky and Halloween Themed Games","com":"October is fast approaching, what spooky games will you be playing this year? <br>I&#039;m going to play Silent Hill 3 for the first time and also Dead Space. <br>I&#039;m looking for other spooky games to play BUT not necessarily horror games, what I really want to see are some more upbeat, &quot;festive&quot;, themed games that are more about the spirit of the season and the atmosphere of trick or treating and Halloween in general. The pic related is sort of the feeling I&#039;m looking for.<br>Anybody have any suggestions? Also taking movie recs in that same vein.","filename":"The feeling","ext":".png","w":1796,"h":1057,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":147,"tim":1789775117194728,"time":1789775117,"md5":"4IVhdlUkFy67HFB60oCogg==","fsize":4112100,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"spooky-and-halloween-themed-games","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":8,"images":7,"omitted_posts":3,"omitted_images":3,"last_replies":[{"no":747990592,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:58:59","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989457\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989457<\/a><br>That&#039;s pretty cool, not really what I&#039;m looking for but still neat. Is there a link?","filename":"1607141792556","ext":".webm","w":510,"h":384,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":94,"tim":1789779539955781,"time":1789779539,"md5":"DIOAuinKcEeEvQ8vRbwxpA==","fsize":3068158,"resto":747986873},{"no":747990856,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:03:26","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990592\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990592<\/a><br>https:\/\/hiddenpalace.org\/Splatterwo<wbr>rld:_Rick_to_Kyoufu_no_Daiou_(Proto<wbr>type)<br>https:\/\/romhack.ing\/database\/conten<wbr>t\/entry\/uz8qKfAyQo2GkTX_DHwt6g\/spla<wbr>tterworld-english-translation","time":1789779806,"resto":747986873},{"no":747991223,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:10:58","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990856\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990856<\/a><br>Appreciate it, I&#039;ll check it out.","filename":"1623261052568","ext":".jpg","w":2880,"h":1620,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":70,"tim":1789780258657540,"time":1789780258,"md5":"NogpOaTSaYKOMpJv8Chtqw==","fsize":1769746,"resto":747986873,"m_img":1},{"no":747992080,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:27:56","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747986873\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747986873<\/a><br>HorrorVale<br>It&#039;s inspired by EB, but it&#039;s not about depression, so it&#039;s good. Its main thing is that there are around 25 optional party members, so there&#039;s a lot of replayability. Which is a great trait for a playable Halloween Special to have. There&#039;s no trick-or-treating vibe aside from chests being pails that look like pumpkins, however. It&#039;s just a lot of horror references in a not scary tone. And a lot of those references are for internet horror because the idea started as &quot;new horror vs old horror&quot;. Also, it&#039;s getting a console port soon. It has a mild visual upgrade to the battle screens and a new NPC made by a fan that&#039;s one of the chopping mall robots but the most flamboyantly gay twink you could imagine.<br><br>As for what I&#039;m gonna play next month, aside from HorrorVale (again), I plan on playing BK: the Bear Witch Project, and rn I&#039;m really into Yokai Watch Blasters ++. And if I can&#039;t stop playing it into OCT it won&#039;t be detrimental to the Halloween spirit because, like, half the yokai in it are ghosts, and this is the game that&#039;s doing a Ghostbusters parody. Also, this mod adds in the zombie yo-kai from YKW 3 and like a dozen of the Halloween variants from the mobile games as costumes.<br><a href=\"#p747987276\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987276<\/a><br>Can&#039;t you summon Hitler in that?","filename":"he&#039;s just racist","ext":".png","w":683,"h":522,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":95,"tim":1789781276416662,"time":1789781276,"md5":"0h2ecRr5a2SFAI6TGq4M5g==","fsize":166957,"resto":747986873},{"no":747992212,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:23","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747986873\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747986873<\/a><br>I have a few suggestions for you since I enjoy these types of games. They might not all be up your alley, so I tried to give a bit of context for why I liked them.<br><br>Crow Country has a good balance of spooky and comfy with old school RE style gameplay. Pretty solid story as well, in my opinion. It&#039;s fun to unravel the mystery. <br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/<wbr>1996010\/Crow_Country\/<br><br>Tainted Pact games all have great creepy atmosphere. Not explicitly Halloween but they are all horror themed. Skin Stapler the most recent one leans pretty heavy into camp and comedy in addition to the horror. I can only personally vouch for Skin Stapler and Massacre at the Mirage and Suffer the Night, but all of them have good reviews. <br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/cura<wbr>tor\/43086730<br><br>Puppet Combo makes good atmospheric games, although I&#039;d say they can be lower on the quality side of things, like indie jank. They all have excellent voice acting though, which is a big plus in my opinion. They aren&#039;t on steam, if you subscribe to their Patreon you can get all the games for $10 I think. I recommend Ding Dong Dead, it&#039;s set during Halloween. Sniper Killer and Skin Freak are also good.<br>https:\/\/www.patreon.com\/puppetcombo<wbr>\/posts\/ding-dong-dead-90878848<br><br>A few other small\/short indie games that you might like:<br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/<wbr>3478700\/The_Children_of_Clay\/<br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/<wbr>3983920\/Hollowbrook__Apartments\/<br>https:\/\/616games.itch.io\/halloween-<wbr>revenge<br>Hollowbrook Apartments and Halloween Revenge aren&#039;t really amazing games but I specifically remember liking the Halloween atmosphere in them.<br><br>Spooky Tales has a demo out, again it has great atmosphere but not specifically Halloween themed. You might want to wait for the full release but I don&#039;t think it&#039;s going to come out by Halloween since there&#039;s no date listed yet.<br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/<wbr>5072590\/Spooky_Tales_Demo\/","filename":"spooky tales","ext":".jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":70,"tim":1789781423720121,"time":1789781423,"md5":"pkAzNvqH0gdZ5mSzuCe0vQ==","fsize":671394,"resto":747986873,"m_img":1}],"last_modified":1789781423},{"no":747983449,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)18:43:12","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Deadlock","com":"HOW the fuck is this the main game mode?<br><br>No shot this has mass market appeal lol","filename":"Deadlock is shit","ext":".jpg","w":2144,"h":1202,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":140,"tim":1789771392009299,"time":1789771392,"md5":"mxkxzWkinkRxPCI9pvu7wQ==","fsize":589287,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"deadlock","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":19,"images":5,"omitted_posts":14,"omitted_images":3,"last_replies":[{"no":747989502,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:38:24","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989295\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989295<\/a><br>75k is a ton of people and enough to put it in the Top 10 most played on Steam, the fuck you on about?","time":1789778304,"resto":747983449},{"no":747990496,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:57:06","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747985630\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747985630<\/a><br>I&#039;m 100% sure you wouldn&#039;t complain if to do damage you&#039;d need to hit a dummy for 8 hours to bind a combo into muscle memory","time":1789779426,"resto":747983449},{"no":747991626,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:19:14","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989502\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989502<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;75k is a ton of people<\/span><br>not for Valve","filename":"Capture","ext":".jpg","w":716,"h":121,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":21,"tim":1789780754333375,"time":1789780754,"md5":"MDQM6Fp\/Xs3w8uBb9y3ZOw==","fsize":17864,"resto":747983449},{"no":747991890,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:24:30","name":"Anonymous","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;Call the game &quot;deadlock&quot;<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;It&#039;s dead<\/span><br>haha lol","time":1789781070,"resto":747983449},{"no":747992208,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:19","name":"Anonymous","com":"Deadlock is a shit moba and a shit shooter","filename":"1684553412506188","ext":".jpg","w":600,"h":602,"tn_w":124,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789781419976060,"time":1789781419,"md5":"C9hD0eftKDwIAubKcYC23Q==","fsize":62309,"resto":747983449}],"last_modified":1789781419},{"no":747990810,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:02:34","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Splatoon","com":"I love you, Heavy Splatling.","filename":"Love can bloom in the Weapons Shop","ext":".png","w":800,"h":666,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":208,"tim":1789779754755688,"time":1789779754,"md5":"e2H8E8ZmZPo6nxG1KWgxOA==","fsize":187469,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"splatoon","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":3,"images":0,"last_replies":[{"no":747991126,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:09:17","name":"Anonymous","com":"built for octoling cock","time":1789780157,"resto":747990810},{"no":747992121,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:28:44","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990810\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990810<\/a><br>mini splat is better","time":1789781324,"resto":747990810},{"no":747992206,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:18","name":"Anonymous","com":"I feel bad for finding squids sexy, not octolings tho","time":1789781418,"resto":747990810}],"last_modified":1789781418},{"no":747990634,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:59:37","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Harem appreciation thread","com":"<span class=\"quote\">&gt;Tifa and Yuffie in FF7 Rebirth <\/span><br><br>These are two of my five wives ( Aerith, Ada and Yennefer )","filename":"Final Fantasy VII","ext":".jpg","w":1638,"h":2048,"tn_w":199,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789779577293623,"time":1789779577,"md5":"kIydvHfwHlEnuFV5yrY+CQ==","fsize":265198,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"harem-appreciation-thread","custom_spoiler":1,"spoiler":1,"replies":3,"images":1,"last_replies":[{"no":747990813,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:02:37","name":"Anonymous","com":"You&#039;re not going to be a \/v\/ celebrity.","time":1789779757,"resto":747990634},{"no":747992079,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:27:55","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990634\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990634<\/a><br>why did you spoiler your image","time":1789781275,"resto":747990634},{"no":747992196,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:13","name":"Anonymous","com":"Sephiroth if he Texan","filename":"1763981084493432","ext":".png","w":767,"h":573,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":93,"tim":1789781413533949,"time":1789781413,"md5":"KL5WroMoZoesa8dBj4IkAA==","fsize":568781,"resto":747990634}],"last_modified":1789781413},{"no":747988006,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:08:36","name":"Anonymous","com":"I really, REALLY like this demo.<br><br>https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/<wbr>3230070\/Duat_Beyond_Light__Shadow\/","filename":"duat boy","ext":".jpg","w":1080,"h":1080,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789776516216518,"time":1789776516,"md5":"5Vnwohtznx5Ccf8n4QersA==","fsize":177364,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"i-really-really-like-this-demo","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":14,"images":3,"omitted_posts":9,"omitted_images":2,"last_replies":[{"no":747989831,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:44:53","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988006\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988006<\/a><br>I love cute brown boys ToT","time":1789778693,"resto":747988006},{"no":747990409,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:55:38","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988006\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988006<\/a><br><a href=\"#p747988069\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988069<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;let me copy your homework<\/span><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;okay but don&#039;t make it too obvious<\/span>","filename":"1768960840961397","ext":".jpg","w":1000,"h":1122,"tn_w":111,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789779338372223,"time":1789779338,"md5":"DGOXdLPXtbtYXrqsUx6Ouw==","fsize":224228,"resto":747988006,"m_img":1},{"no":747991949,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:25:29","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988690\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988690<\/a><br>fake screenshot","time":1789781129,"resto":747988006},{"no":747992015,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:26:44","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990409\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990409<\/a><br>Looks way sexier than this boring fag","time":1789781204,"resto":747988006},{"no":747992190,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:30:00","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747988006\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747988006<\/a><br>give me more sho centric games","time":1789781400,"resto":747988006}],"last_modified":1789781400},{"no":747990770,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:01:54","name":"Anonymous","com":"I think why a lot of anons currently find gaming to be more miserable nowadays is because they have no one to talk about their games with. They just beat a game and that&#039;s it, they move on to the next thing. They have no one to listen to their thoughts about it, no one to share their experience with, and that kind of repeated pattern really dulls gaming in general, much like how if you had a hobby but no one to share your passion for it with.<br><br>A lot of our enjoyment of games really comes down to our experience AROUND the games rather than just what they provide in and of themselves.<br><br>For example, a lot of people say RE5 is straight ass. I agree, however, I fucking loved it because I finished it on Co-Op with a friend in high school. Same thing with Army of Two on the PS3, veritable kusoge, but I also finished it with a friend on Co-Op and had a lotta fun.<br><br>With single player games, they&#039;re not necessarily more fun, but a better experience when you have someone verh close to talk about them with. My brother and I both played Cyberpunk 2077, and whenever we got together we&#039;d talk about it hours on end, and that honestly enhanced said experience for me, same with many SP games since him and I have similar tastes. And so on and so forth.<br><br>Marvel&#039;s Wolverine is a shit game beyond a shadow of doubt, but I bet someone out there is having fun (at its expense) when they have somebody to laugh at it with.","filename":"today-i-learned-snakes-codec-image-in-super-smash-bros-v0-nyg615fl2mmc1","ext":".jpg","w":188,"h":323,"tn_w":145,"tn_h":250,"tim":1789779714205315,"time":1789779714,"md5":"ghI2dDBr9Rac+Ch0Qs7emA==","fsize":18613,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"i-think-why-a-lot-of-anons-currently-find-gaming","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":19,"images":3,"omitted_posts":14,"omitted_images":2,"last_replies":[{"no":747991963,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:25:54","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991168\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991168<\/a><br>Not your safe space, snowflake","time":1789781154,"resto":747990770},{"no":747992187,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:29:56","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991817\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991817<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;Yes, Snake. Humans are social creatures, and therefore thrive among groups of likely-minded peers. Their lives are enriched by sharing their experiences with said peers, a natural instinct that serves as the basic drive to construct community. You see, in 1932- [reads 5 Wikipedia pages]<\/span>","filename":"Colonel_Campbell_Image","ext":".png","w":474,"h":541,"tn_w":109,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789781396980303,"time":1789781396,"md5":"Yt0ZF0wexDvbhcrdzSvU+A==","fsize":333830,"resto":747990770},{"no":747992253,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:31:20","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991931\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991931<\/a><br>Of course, I&#039;m just pointing out how that could make even a shit game fun to experience, now imagine what it would do for a good game.","time":1789781480,"resto":747990770},{"no":747992292,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:32:21","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991908\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991908<\/a><br>Nah I can&#039;t trust my personal info not falling into the wrong hands here, sorry bro. I&#039;m sure you understand.","time":1789781541,"resto":747990770},{"no":747992930,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:45:05","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991064\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991064<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;I&#039;m sure most of our current traffice are bots<\/span><br>I&#039;m sure most of it is actually schizos who have been buckbroken by this site and now post 1000+ times per day just to attention whore and bait<br>However, yes botting on this site is easily feasible especially if you buy a pass. If wanted (I don&#039;t) I could easily flood 20% of \/v\/ to be all my posts with a couple VPNs and passes to control popular opinion or at the least piss a lot of people off. I have not done this but anyone can do it easily","time":1789782305,"resto":747990770}],"last_modified":1789782305}]},{"page":8,"threads":[{"no":747990743,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:01:30","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Safe to say the Switch 2 is finally worth buying.","com":"Look at those GAMES.","filename":"1788217010567505","ext":".jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":140,"tim":1789779690194643,"time":1789779690,"md5":"+7QXEZWriYEYJFkBHL8MxA==","fsize":403154,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"safe-to-say-the-switch-2-is-finally-worth-buying","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":3,"images":0,"last_replies":[{"no":747991176,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:10:10","name":"Anonymous","com":"oh...thooooose games...lol anon c&#039;mon","time":1789780210,"resto":747990743},{"no":747991474,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:15:53","name":"Anonymous","com":"where can I purchase these fine games from","time":1789780553,"resto":747990743},{"no":747992186,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:29:56","name":"Anonymous","com":"It&#039;s just a shota link machine to me","time":1789781396,"resto":747990743}],"last_modified":1789781396},{"no":747936270,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)04:04:14","name":"Anonymous","sub":"FFFFFRIDAY NIGHT MUTHAFUCKAAAA","com"