r>I think 3v3 is the sweet spot for this series but there is a mugen fangame called MvC Maximum that has seperate 2v2, 3v3, and 4v4 builds with active tag and it&#039;s pretty fun","time":1789778776,"resto":747971169},{"no":747991727,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:21:11","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989297\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989297<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;An upfront decision on fightboxes<\/span><br>wat. do you mean hitbox controller legality, or hitspheres vs hitboxes to detect hits?","time":1789780871,"resto":747971169}],"last_modified":1789780871},{"no":747988781,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:23:42","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Onimusha: Way of the Kino","com":"Burai has been the most kino boss so far. They&#039;re all so fucking fun though I&#039;m having such a good time. It&#039;s been years since I enjoyed a game this much. Ganryu 3 is kicking my ass but I just know I can beat him with better play. So fucking good.","filename":"downloadfile(26)","ext":".jpg","w":2560,"h":1440,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":140,"tim":1789777422267629,"time":1789777422,"md5":"Xg6FkCH9H4AZubYtH4+1BA==","fsize":212252,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"onimusha-way-of-the-kino","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":12,"images":4,"omitted_posts":7,"omitted_images":3,"last_replies":[{"no":747991084,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:08:15","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989469\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989469<\/a><br>Ganryu&#039;s grabs got me, I can never see the bitch coming.","time":1789780095,"resto":747988781},{"no":747991323,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:12:53","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991084\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991084<\/a><br>The grabs in general are bullshit and the hardest moves to avoid in general. Timing on them is really annoying.","time":1789780373,"resto":747988781},{"no":747991368,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:13:39","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991323\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991323<\/a><br>and the slow running stabs, its so slow that i always try to issen them too early","time":1789780419,"resto":747988781},{"no":747991550,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:17:28","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991368\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991368<\/a><br>Those aren&#039;t too bad. It really is just the grabs that are fucking bullshit.","time":1789780648,"resto":747988781},{"no":747991705,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:20:50","name":"Anonymous","com":"I got 3\/4ths into the games story before realizing that the upgrade tree unlocks by doing the oni realms in Kyoto and felt like a dumbass. I even went into the first one immediately after it unlocked and missed the other path to shoot the block and just assumed I needed another story power unlocked. Was very confused on why I had 200k+ red souls and way too many power\/oni stones. Fun game that doesn\u2019t overstay its welcome but wish they had a few more bosses instead of reusing them. Ifu and Burai are my boys and loved their last fight.","filename":"IMG_7370","ext":".jpg","w":640,"h":480,"tn_w":125,"tn_h":93,"tim":1789780850013670,"time":1789780850,"md5":"OUL8oXGoob1S1qFeEFDOZQ==","fsize":61931,"resto":747988781}],"last_modified":1789780850},{"no":747979597,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)17:35:36","name":"Anonymous","com":"Who cares if the video game industry crashes...","filename":"bb6bace4ada0e1fd6651114b295da9c1","ext":".png","w":960,"h":540,"tn_w":250,"tn_h":140,"tim":1789767336884559,"time":1789767336,"md5":"u2us5K2g4f1mURFLKV2pwQ==","fsize":757741,"resto":0,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"who-cares-if-the-video-game-industry-crashes","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":11,"images":9,"omitted_posts":6,"omitted_images":5,"last_replies":[{"no":747986417,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)19:36:14","name":"Anonymous","filename":"many sorrows","ext":".jpg","w":1277,"h":1743,"tn_w":91,"tn_h":125,"tim":1789774574459329,"time":1789774574,"md5":"9BuQHY2SqF2F2zINACRPrA==","fsize":399568,"resto":747979597,"m_img":1},{"no":747987572,