re to go with a more rp route with it with VI like it&#039;s expected then that could very well be a thing","time":1789779209,"resto":747984723},{"no":747991227,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:11:06","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747987095\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747987095<\/a><br><span class=\"quote\">&gt;resulting in only literal no lifers really being competitive<\/span><br>It&#039;s funny how every mmo that touts being &#039;social&#039; or having old school, hard simulation aspects always devolves back into this. It&#039;s almost like there&#039;s a reason they all died out.","time":1789780266,"resto":747984723},{"no":747991454,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:15:25","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747990276\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747990276<\/a><br>GTAO is neither a fantasy game, nor an MMO.<br><br>I&#039;m interested to see what devs can do with 1,000 players simultaneously.","time":1789780525,"resto":747984723},{"no":747991537,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)21:17:08","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747991227\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747991227<\/a><br>Yes, all those A+ sandbox MMOs in the last 20 years. That everybody knows about and tried.","time":1789780628,"resto":747984723}],"last_modified":1789780628},{"no":747989903,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:46:15","name":"Anonymous","sub":"Doom","com":"They wasted too much time on this bullshit story.<br><br>2016 got the point across and it was still more epic.<br><br>Also Have a reaction pic.","filename":"Doom The Dark Doomguy looks around sad confused","ext":".jpg","w":1911,"h":1628,"tn_w":249,"tn_h":212,"tim":1789778775485895,"time":1789778775,"md5":"OBgWDZ7NWmfRB7+plOHPGw==","fsize":477925,"resto":0,"m_img":1,"bumplimit":0,"imagelimit":0,"semantic_url":"doom","custom_spoiler":1,"replies":2,"images":0,"last_replies":[{"no":747990191,"now":"09\/18\/26(Fri)20:51:58","name":"Anonymous","com":"<a href=\"#p747989903\" class=\"quotelink\">&gt;&gt;747989903<\/a><br>doom was better when the dialog was 0, i dont 